  "broader": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/env-wt/804",
  "definition": "Criteria for Evaluation of an Aquatic Resource Buffer",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-12-15",
  "historyNote": "#8062, eff 3-13-04; ss by #8341, eff 4-25-05; ss by #8911, eff 6-20-07; ss by #11000, eff 2-1-16; ss by #12808, eff 12-15-19 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 800)",
